只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Questionnaire-style batch questioning plugin for DeepSeek Harness: 10+ questions at once (single/multi/yes-no toggle/compare/open), per-question skip, fullscreen overlay, two-column recap after submit","id":"gh:1333428345","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-survey","slug":"jinhuang712/dsh-survey","topics":["agent-ui","ai-agent","ask-user","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","human-in-the-loop","llm-tools","questionnaire","survey","tool-calling"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Questionnaire-style batch questioning plugin for DeepSeek Harness: 10+ questions at once (single/mul"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ti/yes-no toggle/compare/open), per-question skip, fullscreen overlay, two-column recap after submit"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-survey"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Ask the user ten questions at once instead of ten times in a row."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`do_a_survey` is a tool plugin for DeepSeek Harness. The model sends a whole questionnaire; the user"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" answers it in one card and submits once."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| Single        | Multi    | Yes/No     | Compare             | Open             |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| Numbered rows | Checkbox | Radio pair | Side-by-side blocks | Multi-line input |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## When you'd want this"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **The agent needs five decisions before it can start.** Without this it asks\none, waits, asks the "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"next — five round trips before any work happens. Here it\nasks once and you answer the lot in a singl"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e card.\n- **You want the answers back as data, not prose.** Each reply arrives as\n`{ id, selected, c"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"ustom?, skipped? }`, so the model never has to parse \"yeah\nthe first one, and skip the last question"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"\" out of a sentence.\n- **Some of it you genuinely don't care about.** Every question has a skip, so\n"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"a survey that asks more than you want to answer costs you a click, not a\nnegotiation."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"When the model calls `do_a_survey`, the Web UI renders the survey by `mode`:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- `compact` — single-question card\n- `inline` — embedded in the conversation column\n- `overlay` — fu"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"llscreen, for compare questions\n- `grid` — matrix of many simple questions"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"All text supports Markdown (code blocks, blockquotes, inline code, bold) and color (`{color:red}text"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"{/color}`). A readable two-column recap follows the submit."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Screenshots of the real toolview, captured from the shipped bundle."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**Grid matrix** — fullscreen overlay for many simple questions, one card each:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**Inline** — survey embedded in the conversation column, filled and submitted together:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**Overlay compare** — fullscreen side-by-side comparison with Markdown:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**Compact** — single-question card with rich question types:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From npm (the scoped name; the unscoped `dsh-survey` on the registry is not\nthis package):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Or pinned to a release — build artifacts are committed, so there is nothing to\nbuild:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Or track `main` to pick up unreleased commits:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Or from a local checkout, linked so edits show up on refresh:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If your dsh profile directory is a pnpm workspace, pnpm asks for `-w` before\ntouching its root — pas"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"s it through: `dsh plugin --profile web add -w …`."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"After install, the `do_a_survey` tool and its survey UI are available permanently."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The companion skill `dsh-survey` registers with the install (`dsh.skills` declaration):"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- a usage guide covering the four modes and five question types\n- a dynamic-plugin fallback recipe ("},{"id":"p30s2","text":"`references/dynamic-plugin-fallback.md`) for environments without the bundle"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Tell the model what you want to collect; it calls `do_a_survey(mode, questions)`. `mode` is required"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"ell the model what you want to collect; it calls `do_a_survey(mode, questions)`. `mode` is required:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| mode        | When                                   | Presentation                          |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `\"compact\"` | Exactly 1 question                     | Compact single-question card          |\n| `"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"\"inline\"`  | Multiple questions, no compare         | Embedded in the conversation column   |\n| `\"ov"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"erlay\"` | Compare questions or wide canvas       | Fullscreen overlay (1180px)           |\n| `\"grid\""},{"id":"p34s4","text":"`    | Many simple questions (yes/no, single) | Fullscreen grid matrix, one card each |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Example:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"`header` is an optional short heading shown beside the question number. A trailing `(recommended)` o"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"n a label becomes a badge."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"- **Full Markdown** — question text, option labels/descriptions, compare blocks and recap all render"},{"id":"p39s2","text":" through the official safe renderer\n- micromark + protocol allowlist + shiki highlighting\n- code blo"},{"id":"p39s3","text":"cks, blockquotes, inline code, bold\n- **Color** — `{color:red}text{/color}` (named / `#hex` / `rgb()"},{"id":"p39s4","text":"`), usable in questions, options, compare blocks\n- **Skip / restore** — per-question ✕ grays out, ↺ "},{"id":"p39s5","text":"restores; submitted as `skipped: true`\n- **Fullscreen overlay** — `mode: \"overlay\"` centers fullscre"},{"id":"p39s6","text":"en (mask + 1180px), breaking past the 748px conversation column\n- **Grid matrix** — `mode: \"grid\"` f"},{"id":"p39s7","text":"ullscreen grid of many simple questions\n- every card is the same size, controls sit under the questi"},{"id":"p39s8","text":"on, per-card skip\n- card text is inline-only: a fenced block collapses to inline code and hard break"},{"id":"p39s9","text":"s to spaces, so one long question cannot blow open the whole matrix\n- compare questions degrade to a"},{"id":"p39s10","text":" left/right choice\n- **Readable recap** — strict two-column grid, one \"question → answer\" row each\n-"},{"id":"p39s11","text":" **Follows your language** — card copy ships in English and Chinese, tracking the Web UI's language "},{"id":"p39s12","text":"setting\n- falls back to the browser's language where that setting is unavailable\n- answers stay lang"},{"id":"p39s13","text":"uage-neutral, so switching never changes what the model receives\n- **Accessibility** — radio/checkbo"},{"id":"p39s14","text":"x semantics + keyboard focus rings"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"- **Host half** (`lib/index.mjs`): Cordis entry\n- `defineTool` registers `do_a_survey` with a 30-min"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"ute `timeoutMs`\n- `webServer.register` serves `/api/dsh-survey/submit|cancel`\n- `execute` suspends o"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"n the answer, correlated by `exec.callId`; submit, cancel, abort, timeout and unload each release it"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"\n- **Client half** (`src/` → `lib/client.js`): `__ModuleLoader__.load` bundle registering `tool.call"},{"id":"p41s5","text":".toolview` key=`do_a_survey`\n- `runtime.js` binds the host's React and UI primitives from the loader"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"'s `require` — they are never bundled, so the plugin shares the host's React instance\n- `styles.css`"},{"id":"p41s7","text":" the stylesheet, injected once per page\n- `i18n.js` zh/en copy, `markdown.js` Markdown and colour, `"},{"id":"p41s8","text":"answers.js` pick ↔ answer mapping\n- `controls.js` the answer controls, `model.js` draft state and su"},{"id":"p41s9","text":"bmit/cancel\n- `modes/` one file per presentation: `compact`, `survey` (inline + overlay), `grid`, `r"},{"id":"p41s10","text":"ecap`\n- **Skill** (`skills/dsh-survey/SKILL.md`): usage guide + dynamic-plugin fallback recipe (`ref"},{"id":"p41s11","text":"erences/dynamic-plugin-fallback.md`)"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
